OL,3,GNEWSASchools, GPs and businesses hit by
OL,4,Aglobal Microsoft outage as company
OL,5,Ascrambles to solve issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FHow are you affected? Georgia, from
OL,8,FStaffordshire, says the outage has
OL,9,Fdelayed the completion of her first
OL,10,Fhouse purchase. Meanwhile, Martin says
OL,11,Fit was "bliss" to wake up to no emails
OL,12,F- before he realised "today is a
OL,13,Fcrucial day to conclude a business
OL,14,Fdeal"
OL,16,FMicrosoft says it is seeing
OL,17,F"encouraging recovery progress" in
OL,18,FEurope, and North America is
OL,19,F"improving", but adds "some users may
OL,20,Fstill experience intermittent issues".
OL,21,FEarlier, it said the issue wasn't
OL,22,Fcaused by a cyber-security breach
